# Template for the Jenkins "Secret file" credential:
#   main-website-env-stg   → https://api-stg.evolucionapharma.com
#   main-website-env-prod  → https://api.evolucionapharma.com
#
# Save as plain UTF-8 with LF line endings. Docker keeps a trailing CR as part
# of the value, so a file written on Windows produces unusable variables.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is read by Jenkins at image build time (next build inlines
# it into the browser bundle), so changing it here requires a new build.
#
# Do not set PORT or HOSTNAME: the image binds 3001 and the deploy maps that
# port on the host.

NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api-stg.evolucionapharma.com
